source: Chan O, ed. ABC of Emergency Radiology. 3rd ed. Chichester: Wiley-Blackwell (BMJ Books); 2013. || ABC of emergency radiology
source: Raby N, Berman L, de Lacey G. Accident and Emergency Radiology: A Survival Guide. 3rd ed. Edinburgh: Saunders Elsevier; 2015. || accident and emergency radiology survival guide
